00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:13.160
So you guys are both talking about how cool of an idea this is, both that you control four different characters in the same shmup and that they eventually team up to be the final level of this shmup.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:21.040
However, I can't help but feel like you're saying that it also in practice when you actually played this game, it didn't work out.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:33.120
Now, I have my suspicions for why that is, mostly because every character is exactly the same and the levels are exactly the same, minus some sprite changes and color palette stuff.

