The knight, the wizard, the monster and the thief all shoot the same kind of projectile.

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:49.580
Obviously, like I you know, you could say the monsters is fire breath instead of whatever the knight would theoretically be shooting instead of hacking away with a sword.

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.400
