00:23:54.220 --> 00:24:01.860
That works, yeah, when they're different, when there's some difference in either the gameplay or even, like, story or something.

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:08.140
Yeah, this doesn't have much in that department either, so it's just, yeah, you're just doing this, you're starting over.

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:14.180
