00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:36.380
No, just I had an idea of, like, how this game would play before I played it, and then I played it and I realized, like, oh, these things aren't really applicable because it doesn't work like how they pretend it works.

00:24:37.360 --> 00:24:45.100
I mean, I'm always, I always, I always gear towards, like, the magic user and wanting this kind of game, so yeah, so Wizard Khalifa or whatever his name is.

00:24:47.080 --> 00:24:52.260
Wizard Khalifa, I think, is his name, but, yeah, I guess he was my favorite.

