00:29:35.460 --> 00:29:39.100
But, no, it's like that's the default mode of the game.

00:29:39.140 --> 00:29:43.660
And I just want to come back to, like, this whole futility thing.

00:29:44.760 --> 00:29:51.320
Even if you picked up all the power-ups, even if all four characters survived, which you need them to,

00:29:51.320 --> 00:29:54.800
even if you've done everything up to this point correctly,

00:29:55.400 --> 00:30:06.980
the only way sometimes to get the correct character to the front of the pack is to pick up a random rotation.

00:30:10.120 --> 00:30:13.700
