00:36:00.880 --> 00:36:02.200
and have them each bring something

00:36:02.200 --> 00:36:05.260
to the table in this sort of genre bending thing

00:36:05.260 --> 00:36:06.860
is a really cool idea.

00:36:07.140 --> 00:36:09.580
But man, are there a lot of things

00:36:09.580 --> 00:36:11.820
that are really annoying

00:36:11.820 --> 00:36:12.780
about this game.

00:36:12.960 --> 00:36:14.160
Uh, I'm going to say

00:36:14.160 --> 00:36:16.080
despite its intricate

00:36:16.080 --> 00:36:18.080
and complex pause sound,

00:36:18.320 --> 00:36:19.580
this is not essential.

00:36:19.940 --> 00:36:21.340
Love it. And you know, it's funny,

00:36:21.540 --> 00:36:23.180
the concept thing gets to me too.

00:36:23.720 --> 00:36:25.760
I think the fact that we played this

00:36:25.760 --> 00:36:26.800
in 2022,

00:36:27.540 --> 00:36:28.360
it, you know,

00:36:28.420 --> 00:36:30.160
we just knew so many other things

00:36:30.160 --> 00:36:31.060
that they could have baked

00:36:31.060 --> 00:36:33.140
