00:36:53.280 --> 00:36:54.340
that the game plays.

00:36:54.560 --> 00:36:56.060
The, the knight shooting

00:36:56.060 --> 00:36:57.960
a projectile is just never going to get

00:36:58.420 --> 00:36:59.260
solved for me.

00:36:59.260 --> 00:37:00.280
I have no idea

00:37:00.280 --> 00:37:01.780
how, how that happened.

00:37:01.780 --> 00:37:02.840
I will say

00:37:02.840 --> 00:37:04.380
I'm not going to, um,

00:37:04.720 --> 00:37:05.740
I'm not going to make that

00:37:05.740 --> 00:37:06.680
my reason for voting

00:37:06.680 --> 00:37:07.540
this essential or not.

00:37:07.620 --> 00:37:08.440
I have a story.

00:37:08.840 --> 00:37:09.860
At the end

00:37:09.860 --> 00:37:11.540
of every single level

00:37:11.540 --> 00:37:12.400
in this game,

00:37:12.580 --> 00:37:13.640
there just comes a point

00:37:13.640 --> 00:37:15.240
where you've reached the end.

00:37:15.340 --> 00:37:17.000
The, the screen stops scrolling

00:37:17.000 --> 00:37:18.620
and you're stuck there

00:37:18.620 --> 00:37:19.680
for like a minute

00:37:19.680 --> 00:37:20.520
before the game

00:37:20.520 --> 00:37:21.540
takes control

00:37:21.540 --> 00:37:23.660
of your character and forces you

00:37:23.660 --> 00:37:24.900
to walk

00:37:24.900 --> 00:37:25.980
off the screen.

00:37:26.660 --> 00:37:27.780
Now, during that time,

00:37:27.780 --> 00:37:28.840
there might still be enemies

00:37:28.840 --> 00:37:31.280
